    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update to 1.27.0 (supersedes SR 1370148, which carried 1.26.1): hf-cli agent skill install/refresh, engine flags for Inference Endpoints without --custom-image and updatable after deploy, Baseten inference provider, region on space_info/list_spaces. Built and verified on aarch64: %check import smoke test passes for python 3.13 and 3.14, rpmlint 0 errors / 0 warnings / 0 badness, source_validator clean.</comment>
    <requestid>1370303</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="12" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>76af92498e3e344c16ff234a21d8f39d</srcmd5>
    <version>1.28.0</version>
    <time>1787155144</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 1.28.0:
  * Add hf endpoints hardware to list deployable Inference Endpoint
    instances with price and quota
  * Support managed engine images and tensor/data-parallel sizes on
    endpoint deploy and update
  * Add DeepInfra text-to-speech and feature-extraction
  * Keep hf extensions off the metered GitHub REST API
  * Fix scheduled single-file uploads, Xet tqdm_class handling,
    duplicated GPU rows in hf jobs stats, and using a redirect's
    Content-Length as the file size
  * Drop the undocumented INFERENCE_ENDPOINT_IMAGE_KEYS constant</comment>
    <requestid>1371919</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="13" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>b2b9a6ce937d0c5ff9f798f405086d56</srcmd5>
    <version>1.29.0</version>
    <time>1787939248</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update to 1.29.0.

Two security-relevant upstream fixes: the CVE-2026-15717 path-traversal
validation now also covers &quot;hf buckets sync&quot; / sync_bucket(), which joined
server-supplied keys onto the destination unchecked; and
load_state_dict_from_file() no longer falls back to pickle for a shard named
exactly &quot;.safetensors&quot; (Path.suffix is empty for extension-only names).

Also switches the hf / huggingface-cli / tiny-agents generic names from
update-alternatives to libalternatives, keeping the SLE-15 fallback since the
devel project still builds 15.x.

Runtime dependency floors are unchanged upstream. The only API removal is the
long-deprecated labels= argument of InferenceClient.zero_shot_image_classification();
no Factory consumer uses it and none caps huggingface-hub.

Built locally on aarch64 against openSUSE_Tumbleweed: green, rpmlint 0 errors /
0 warnings / 0 badness.</comment>
    <requestid>1374116</requestid>
  </revision>
